[burbling]

1003
00:49:01.625 --> 00:49:03.625
[tense music playing]

1004
00:49:16.125 --> 00:49:17.708
[yells]

1005
00:49:17.791 --> 00:49:19.083
[gasping]

1006
00:49:19.166 --> 00:49:21.166
[intense music playing]

1007
00:49:23.541 --> 00:49:25.541
-[grunts]
-[splashes]

1008
00:49:31.791 --> 00:49:33.791
[music stops]

1009
00:49:35.833 --> 00:49:38.208
[gasping breaths]

1010
00:49:45.208 --> 00:49:47.375
-[grunts]
-[jarring. intense music playing]

1011
00:49:50.458 --> 00:49:52.666
[screaming]

1012
00:49:53.750 --> 00:49:55.208
[Max] No.

1013
00:49:55.291 --> 00:49:57.208
No. No.

1014
00:49:57.291 --> 00:49:59.166
No. no. no. no. no. no!

1015
00:49:59.250 --> 00:50:00.916
[sobbing] No! No.

1016
00:50:01.000 --> 00:50:02.750
-Oh. my God.
-[Max] No.

1017
00:50:03.833 --> 00:50:05.916
No one's coming for us.

1018
00:50:06.000 --> 00:50:07.840
What-what-what... what do we do?
What do we do?

1019
00:50:07.916 --> 00:50:11.833
We figure out which of the two paths
Wat took. and then we take the other one.

1020
00:50:11.916 --> 00:50:14.458
-No. that's impossible.
-Wait. wait. There is another way.

1021
00:50:14.541 --> 00:50:16.375
We can get to the ocean in the next cave.

1022
00:50:16.458 --> 00:50:17.833
-The ocean?
-Yes. I saw the passage

1023
00:50:17.916 --> 00:50:21.041
that leads to the hatch
that opens to the sea.

1024
00:50:21.125 --> 00:50:23.267
-Look. It's the shortest way.
-[Max] Okay. just wait. wait. wait. wait.

1025
00:50:23.291 --> 00:50:24.458
wait. wait. wait. wait.

1026
00:50:24.541 --> 00:50:25.916
We have a map to the caves.

1027
00:50:26.000 --> 00:50:28.458
We do not have a map
to the ocean. okay. so... [stammers]

1028
00:50:28.541 --> 00:50:31.750
W-We don't know where
it's gonna spit us out in the ocean.

1029
00:50:31.833 --> 00:50:34.375
There's a reason that the shark
is stuck in here.

1030
00:50:35.083 --> 00:50:36.083
No.

1031
00:50:36.166 --> 00:50:37.750
-Adrienne.
-[Adrienne whimpering] No.

1032
00:50:37.833 --> 00:50:39.601
You're hurt and you're bleeding.
and we have to

1033
00:50:39.625 --> 00:50:40.684
-get you help.
-No. Max. don't leave me.

1034
00:50:40.708 --> 00:50:41.892
-You have to stay up here.
-I'm not like you.

1035
00:50:41.916 --> 00:50:43.184
No. Adrienne. that's what I'm saying.

1036
00:50:43.208 --> 00:50:46.041
[sobbing] No. Greg is dead!
He's dead. and you're all just...

1037
00:50:46.125 --> 00:50:48.583
you're all just arguing. and he's gone.

1038
00:50:48.666 --> 00:50:50.916
-I don't want to die here alone.
-[James] Okay.

1039
00:50:51.000 --> 00:50:54.041
Okay. Okay.
Why don't we all just wait here?

1040
00:50:54.125 --> 00:50:55.750
When someone realizes

1041
00:50:55.833 --> 00:50:57.226
-Wat hasn't come back. we...
-[Max] It's a holiday.

1042
00:50:57.250 --> 00:50:59.875
We're not gonna post up here
and just wait for no one. James.

1043
00:50:59.958 --> 00:51:02.541
I can stay with her. and...
and you guys just go.

1044
00:51:02.625 --> 00:51:04.458
No. I don't like any of this.

1045
00:51:04.541 --> 00:51:06.541
We have to face the facts.

1046
00:51:06.625 --> 00:51:09.083
Wat did this for a living.
and he's dead. okay?

1047
00:51:09.166 --> 00:51:10.926
So the three of us.
we have to stick together

1048
00:51:11.000 --> 00:51:13.375
so we can get help for Adrienne.

1049
00:51:13.458 --> 00:51:15.208
[sniffling]

1050
00:51:16.250 --> 00:51:18.083
I can't leave her.

1051
00:51:19.166 --> 00:51:20.791
Fine.

1052
00:51:20.875 --> 00:51:23.125
Then give me the map.
because James and I are going.

1053
00:51:23.208 --> 00:51:24.888
I don't think we should leave her. either.

1054
00:51:24.958 --> 00:51:26.083
James.

1055
00:51:26.166 --> 00:51:28.375
No. there's got to be a way
that we can get help

1056
00:51:28.458 --> 00:51:31.541
without leaving one of our friends
alone and bleeding.

1057
00:51:31.625 --> 00:51:33.500
Then you two stay with her.
but give me the map

1058
00:51:33.583 --> 00:51:35.125
so I can save your asses.

1059
00:51:35.208 --> 00:51:36.208
No.

1060
00:51:36.291 --> 00:51:38.708
-No. No. Max. No. please don't.
-Sara. Sara. give me the map.

1061
00:51:38.791 --> 00:51:40.458
-Okay.
-No. don't. No. no. no. no. no!

1062
00:51:40.541 --> 00:51:42.541
Give it to me! Give it to me!

1063
00:51:42.625 --> 00:51:44.125
-[screaming]
-Adrienne!

1064
00:51:44.208 --> 00:51:45.916
-Get out of the water! Come on!
-[gasping]

1065
00:51:46.000 --> 00:51:47.583
Get out of the water! Come on!

1066
00:51:47.666 --> 00:51:50.250
[gasping. coughing]

1067
00:51:50.333 --> 00:51:52.059
-Pull me up. Pull me up.
-Hurry. hurry. hurry. hurry.

1068
00:51:52.083 --> 00:51:54.250
-Pull me up. Pull me up.
-[tense music playing]

1069
00:51:54.333 --> 00:51:55.625
Help!

1070
00:51:55.708 --> 00:51:57.750
Pull me up! Pull me up!

1071
00:51:57.833 --> 00:51:58.833
Adrienne. hurry up!

1072
00:51:58.916 --> 00:52:00.892
-[James] Reach. Reach.
-[Adrienne] Okay. help me! Help me!

1073
00:52:00.916 --> 00:52:02.836
-[sobbing] Help.
-[James] Adrienne. grab my hand!

1074
00:52:03.500 --> 00:52:05.250
[Adrienne] Pull me up. Pull me up.

1075
00:52:06.875 --> 00:52:09.458
Come on. come on. come on.
Adrienne. reach! Grab my hand.

1076
00:52:09.541 --> 00:52:11.666
-[Sara] Come on. come on.
-[James] Come on. come on.

1077
00:52:12.875 --> 00:52:14.958
-[Adrienne screams]
-[thudding]

1078
00:52:15.041 --> 00:52:17.208
[screaming. whimpering]

1079
00:52:17.291 --> 00:52:18.708
[James] Oh. God!

1080
00:52:23.041 --> 00:52:25.000
It's stuck! It's stuck!

1081
00:52:26.750 --> 00:52:28.267
If it can't swim forward.
it can't breathe.

1082
00:52:28.291 --> 00:52:30.041
Yeah. and it can't swim backwards.

1083
00:52:31.875 --> 00:52:34.833
Ade. listen. I think we can go.
but we've got to go right now.

1084
00:52:34.916 --> 00:52:35.976
-No.
-[James] Yeah. yeah. yeah.

1085
00:52:36.000 --> 00:52:37.125
Adrienne. we will help you.

1086
00:52:37.208 --> 00:52:40.048
-Okay. but we got to go right now. though.
-Hey. hey. hey. Listen to me.

1087
00:52:40.750 --> 00:52:44.458
I'll carry you the whole way.
but you got to get back in the water.

1088
00:52:47.000 --> 00:52:49.309
-[Max] Come on. let's go!
-[Sara] I'll count us in. Let's go.

1089
00:52:49.333 --> 00:52:51.226
-[Max] One at a time. One at a time.
-[shouts frantically. screams]

1090
00:52:51.250 --> 00:52:52.708
-[screams]
-[James] No. Adrienne!

1091
00:52:52.791 --> 00:52:54.791
[intense music playing]

1092
00:52:57.083 --> 00:52:58.625
[Sara] All right. I'm-I'm coming.

1093
00:52:58.708 --> 00:53:00.250
I'm coming!

1094
00:53:00.333 --> 00:53:01.833
Get closer.

1095
00:53:01.916 --> 00:53:03.333
I can't reach.

1096
00:53:03.416 --> 00:53:04.583
Adrienne.

1097
00:53:04.666 --> 00:53:06.250
Can you grab my hand?

1098
00:53:06.333 --> 00:53:07.916
-Adrienne.
-[Max] Look. Look.

1099
00:53:08.000 --> 00:53:09.000
No.

1100
00:53:09.833 --> 00:53:10.916
[James] Swim!

1101
00:53:11.000 --> 00:53:12.059
-[screams]
-[Sara] Hurry up!

1102
00:53:12.083 --> 00:53:14.500
-Adrienne! Grab my hand!
-Come on!

1103
00:53:14.583 --> 00:53:15.708
[James] Grab my hand!

1104
00:53:15.791 --> 00:53:17.458
-[screaming]
-Grab it!

1105
00:53:19.250 --> 00:53:22.166
[screaming]

1106
00:53:35.250 --> 00:53:36.916
[screaming stops]

1107
00:53:41.041 --> 00:53:43.500
[heavy. shuddering breaths]

1108
00:53:45.458 --> 00:53:47.375
[voice shaking] This is so messed up.

1109
00:53:48.875 --> 00:53:50.208
I... I can't...

1110
00:53:50.291 --> 00:53:53.250
[voice shaking] How did...
She-she-she-she was...

1111
00:53:53.333 --> 00:53:55.166
Gone.

1112
00:53:55.250 --> 00:53:57.500
[somber music playing]

1113
00:53:57.583 --> 00:53:59.583
[sobbing]

1114
00:54:05.583 --> 00:54:07.625
[whimpers]

1115
00:54:13.416 --> 00:54:14.916
[grunts]

1116
00:54:15.625 --> 00:54:17.250
[whimpering]

1117
00:54:24.500 --> 00:54:26.583
I've never seen anyone die before.

1118
00:54:30.666 --> 00:54:32.625
Now I've seen two. [sniffles]

1119
00:54:35.250 --> 00:54:36.541
We could've saved her.

1120
00:54:36.625 --> 00:54:38.416
You would've died. too.

1121
00:54:40.708 --> 00:54:42.916
We need to get out of here.
This ledge is crumbling.

1122
00:54:43.916 --> 00:54:46.000
-[Max whimpering]
-The ocean outlet.

1123
00:54:47.541 --> 00:54:48.958
The honeycomb caves.

1124
00:54:49.041 --> 00:54:51.375
We have to go
where it can't follow us easily.

1125
00:54:51.458 --> 00:54:54.250
So maybe it'll get stuck again.
Maybe it'll die.

1126
00:54:54.333 --> 00:54:56.958
So the narrower the passage.
the better. so...

1127
00:54:57.041 --> 00:54:58.434
The less time we spend in here.
the better.

1128
00:54:58.458 --> 00:55:00.958
And the ocean is the closest way out.
away from the shark.

1129
00:55:01.041 --> 00:55:03.208
Do you know where
the shark came from. Sara?

1130
00:55:03.291 --> 00:55:04.458
The ocean. okay?

1131
00:55:04.541 --> 00:55:06.916
And I'm willing to bet
it's not the only one in there.

1132
00:55:07.000 --> 00:55:08.791
But I think our odds are better out there.

1133
00:55:08.875 --> 00:55:10.142
'Cause if we get attacked in here...

1134
00:55:10.166 --> 00:55:11.458
But it can't follow us in there.

1135
00:55:11.541 --> 00:55:13.333
-You don't know that.
-[James] Hey. hey. hey.

1136
00:55:13.416 --> 00:55:15.500
Both of you. just chill.

1137
00:55:16.916 --> 00:55:18.583
Okay? We're all going together.

1138
00:55:20.166 --> 00:55:24.541
Honestly. I think what Sara is saying
makes a lot of sense.

1139
00:55:24.625 --> 00:55:26.458
Why are you taking her side?

1140
00:55:26.541 --> 00:55:28.375
I'm not taking anyone's side.

1141
00:55:28.458 --> 00:55:30.166
I just want to stick together.

1142
00:55:30.750 --> 00:55:32.476
Are you saying
I can't take care of my friends?

1143
00:55:32.500 --> 00:55:34.375
You always do this!

1144
00:55:35.750 --> 00:55:37.208
You twist things!

1145
00:55:37.291 --> 00:55:39.291
I'm tired of it.

1146
00:55:39.375 --> 00:55:41.708
Being with you is tiring.

1147
00:55:46.125 --> 00:55:48.291
-Max. um...
-[stifled sobs]

1148
00:55:48.375 --> 00:55:50.017
-It's not like that. I...
-[Max clears throat]

1149
00:55:50.041 --> 00:55:51.541
Okay.

1150
00:55:56.625 --> 00:56:00.333
Then let me make this really easy
for the both of you.

1151
00:56:13.333 --> 00:56:14.791
James. no.

1152
00:56:16.291 --> 00:56:17.583
Are you kidding me?

1153
00:56:18.291 --> 00:56:20.500
I can't let her go alone. I'm sorry.

1154
00:56:25.166 --> 00:56:26.208
[sighs]

1155
00:56:26.291 --> 00:56:27.666
You're kidding me.

1156
00:56:28.666 --> 00:56:30.666
[breathing heavily]

1157
00:56:36.041 --> 00:56:37.041
[James] Max.

1158
00:56:38.000 --> 00:56:39.083
James.

1159
00:56:42.291 --> 00:56:43.583
You're coming with me?

1160
00:56:43.666 --> 00:56:45.500
Of course.

1161
00:56:45.583 --> 00:56:47.208
[Sara] Ocean outlet's right there.

1162
00:56:50.583 --> 00:56:54.000
But you're right. we don't know what's on
the other side. so we'll try it your way.

1163
00:56:54.083 --> 00:56:56.125
[panting] Okay. Thank you.

1164
00:56:57.666 --> 00:57:00.750
We're in the Skeleton Cave.
which connects to the Honeycomb Tunnel.

1165
00:57:00.833 --> 00:57:02.583
Okay. Okay.

1166
00:57:02.666 --> 00:57:03.666
Let's do it.

1167
00:57:06.750 --> 00:57:08.250
Thank you for trusting me.

1168
00:57:08.333 --> 00:57:09.541
I mean it.

1169
00:57:10.541 --> 00:57:12.541
[atmospheric music playing]

1170
00:57:19.541 --> 00:57:21.958
[Max] Map says there's
an underwater entrance here.

1171
00:57:24.375 --> 00:57:26.875
Okay. wait. No one panic.

1172
00:57:26.958 --> 00:57:28.500
I'll go check it out.

1173
00:57:33.416 --> 00:57:35.416
[panting quietly]

1174
00:57:37.458 --> 00:57:40.208
Look. I made a call back there.

1175
00:57:40.291 --> 00:57:42.958
We let her go off on her own.
how is that any better

1176
00:57:43.041 --> 00:57:44.392
than what happened to you yesterday?

1177
00:57:44.416 --> 00:57:46.166
Because I'm not the one who swam away.

1178
00:57:46.250 --> 00:57:48.916
I'm the one who got left behind.

1179
00:57:49.000 --> 00:57:51.101
Don't pretend like you're not
part of the problem. too.

1180
00:57:51.125 --> 00:57:52.500
What does that mean?

1181
00:57:52.583 --> 00:57:54.416
You let her be in charge.

1182
00:57:56.375 --> 00:57:58.916
[Max breathing heavily]

1183
00:58:00.791 --> 00:58:02.625
[Max] It's a long breath hold.

1184
00:58:02.708 --> 00:58:04.583
but we can do it.

1185
00:58:05.583 --> 00:58:07.916
I'm safe. I'm special. I'm me.

1186
00:58:15.375 --> 00:58:16.625
Ladies first.

1187
00:58:22.375 --> 00:58:24.375
[suspenseful music playing]

1188
00:58:44.375 --> 00:58:46.375
♪ ♪

1189
00:58:55.125 --> 00:58:56.541
Where do we go from here?

1190
00:58:56.625 --> 00:58:59.145
The map says that this cave
definitely connects to the entrance.

1191
00:58:59.208 --> 00:59:02.416
but the only way that I can
figure it out... is through up there.

1192
00:59:06.333 --> 00:59:08.500
I think the shark's
definitely not up there.

1193
00:59:18.500 --> 00:59:19.708
[grunting]

1194
00:59:27.750 --> 00:59:28.790
-[grunts]
-[debris falling]

1195
00:59:28.833 --> 00:59:30.208
[gasps]

1196
00:59:33.750 --> 00:59:36.166
[straining]

1197
00:59:44.041 --> 00:59:45.416
[grunts]

1198
00:59:45.500 --> 00:59:47.625
[panting]

1199
00:59:47.708 --> 00:59:49.375
[straining]

1200
00:59:51.625 --> 00:59:54.041
It's narrow. Like. really narrow.

1201
00:59:55.166 --> 00:59:57.583
-Then we better start crawling.
-Okay.

1202
00:59:59.666 --> 01:00:01.958
[rustling]

1203
01:00:02.041 --> 01:00:04.041
[grunting]

1204
01:00:10.791 --> 01:00:13.000
[Sara groans. pants]

1205
01:00:19.875 --> 01:00:21.583
I don't want to die in here.

1206
01:00:22.333 --> 01:00:24.416
None of us want to die. babe.

1207
01:00:24.500 --> 01:00:29.666
No. I mean. I can't die while I'm. like...

1208
01:00:29.750 --> 01:00:32.250
dicking around in Thailand.

1209
01:00:32.333 --> 01:00:34.125
I can't do that to my parents.

1210
01:00:37.208 --> 01:00:38.791
I wasted my life.

1211
01:00:40.833 --> 01:00:44.791
I should've. I don't know. uh. uh.
taken things more seriously

1212
01:00:44.875 --> 01:00:49.875
and not put off growing up
until law school.

1213
01:00:50.916 --> 01:00:53.416
What if that's all my mom gets of me?

1214
01:00:56.791 --> 01:00:57.875
Being an idiot.

1215
01:00:58.458 --> 01:00:59.791
You're not an idiot.

1216
01:00:59.875 --> 01:01:01.208
Not even close.

1217
01:01:01.291 --> 01:01:03.250
I wasted so much time.

1218
01:01:04.416 --> 01:01:06.541
[Sara] We're gonna get out of here.

1219
01:01:08.166 --> 01:01:10.458
We just got to keep moving.

1220
01:01:12.541 --> 01:01:14.541
If I get out of here. I swear I'm gonna...

1221
01:01:14.625 --> 01:01:16.000
[screaming]

1222
01:01:16.083 --> 01:01:18.958
No. no. no! No. no. no!

1223
01:01:19.041 --> 01:01:21.000
[all breathing heavily]

1224
01:01:22.000 --> 01:01:24.250
No. No.

1225
01:01:32.458 --> 01:01:33.833
[grunts]

1226
01:01:35.916 --> 01:01:37.416
What is that?

1227
01:01:37.500 --> 01:01:39.500
[distant chirping]

1228
01:01:40.791 --> 01:01:42.291
Shh!

1229
01:01:44.541 --> 01:01:46.666
-You guys hear that?
-[birds chirping]

1230
01:01:46.750 --> 01:01:49.500
[gentle. hopeful music playing]

1231
01:01:52.166 --> 01:01:54.416
Can you turn your light off for a sec?

1232
01:01:54.500 --> 01:01:56.125
[chirping continues]

1233
01:01:57.541 --> 01:01:58.958
[Max] Is-is that...

1234
01:01:59.041 --> 01:02:01.041
[laughing] Is that daylight?

1235
01:02:01.125 --> 01:02:03.208
Oh. my God. Oh. my God. go. go. go!

1236
01:02:03.291 --> 01:02:05.375
Let's get the hell out of here!
Oh. my God.

1237
01:02:05.458 --> 01:02:06.750
[screams]

1238
01:02:06.833 --> 01:02:08.000
[James yells]

1239
01:02:08.083 --> 01:02:09.375
[pained grunt]

1240
01:02:09.458 --> 01:02:11.125
What do I do? What's underneath me?

1241
01:02:11.208 --> 01:02:13.875
-Hold on to Sara's hand.
-No. I can't. She's gonna drop me.

1242
01:02:13.958 --> 01:02:15.375
Stop.

1243
01:02:17.291 --> 01:02:19.291
[tense music playing]

1244
01:02:22.291 --> 01:02:23.916
Don't move.

1245
01:02:31.291 --> 01:02:33.083
[trembling breaths]

1246
01:02:33.166 --> 01:02:35.083
[whimpering]

1247
01:02:36.291 --> 01:02:37.625
[gasps]

1248
01:02:50.583 --> 01:02:53.416
-[gasping. whimpering]
-[rocks splashing]

1249
01:02:55.416 --> 01:02:56.416
No.

1250
01:02:56.500 --> 01:02:58.041
[whimpering]

1251
01:03:04.750 --> 01:03:06.958
[Sara] James. stop. It's gonna break.

1252
01:03:08.375 --> 01:03:10.375
[Max continues whimpering]

1253
01:03:12.250 --> 01:03:13.291
-It's gone.
-[Max yells]

1254
01:03:13.375 --> 01:03:15.083
Okay. get her up. get her up. get her up!

1255
01:03:15.166 --> 01:03:18.041
-I can't reach. Pull her up.
-[Sara] I can't. I can't.

1256
01:03:18.125 --> 01:03:19.291
[grunts]

1257
01:03:19.375 --> 01:03:21.416
-I can't. I can't.
-Help. Help me.

1258
01:03:21.500 --> 01:03:23.833
[straining]

1259
01:03:23.916 --> 01:03:25.416
-[yelps]
-[Max screams]

1260
01:03:25.500 --> 01:03:27.541
-[sharp. heavy breathing]
-I have to let you go.

1261
01:03:27.625 --> 01:03:29.250
No. No. babe. no. no!

1262
01:03:29.333 --> 01:03:31.000
-We're coming with you.
-[screams]

1263
01:03:35.833 --> 01:03:38.041
[atmospheric music playing]

1264
01:03:48.416 --> 01:03:51.041
[birds chirping in distance]

1265
01:03:59.500 --> 01:04:00.791
[breathing heavily]

1266
01:04:00.875 --> 01:04:02.291
We got to go. We got to go.

1267
01:04:02.375 --> 01:04:03.458
Okay. hold on.

1268
01:04:03.541 --> 01:04:05.791
Let me just check. Let me look.

1269
01:04:05.875 --> 01:04:07.958
Okay? One second. [inhales deeply]

1270
01:04:25.916 --> 01:04:27.916
[panting]

1271
01:04:29.458 --> 01:04:31.416
Okay.

1272
01:04:31.500 --> 01:04:33.708
There's a tunnel down here.

1273
01:04:33.791 --> 01:04:36.000
And it has an air pocket.
and I can see it.

1274
01:04:36.083 --> 01:04:39.791
but then we have to hold our breath
and swim to the air pocket.

1275
01:04:39.875 --> 01:04:41.416
Do you think we can do it?

1276
01:04:41.500 --> 01:04:43.125
There's no other choice.

1277
01:04:44.208 --> 01:04:45.666
We can do it.

1278
01:04:47.916 --> 01:04:49.083
All right.

1279
01:04:52.708 --> 01:04:54.708
[tense. atmospheric music playing]

1280
01:05:20.541 --> 01:05:22.416
[gasping]

1281
01:05:23.541 --> 01:05:26.500
That felt like... like a long breath hold.

1282
01:05:26.583 --> 01:05:28.500
There's not a lot of air in here.

1283
01:05:28.583 --> 01:05:30.416
Try not to talk so much.

1284
01:05:30.500 --> 01:05:32.541
I'm gonna swim ahead. see how far it goes.

1285
01:05:32.625 --> 01:05:34.375
[inhales deeply]

1286
01:05:36.458 --> 01:05:38.666
-Max.
-Hmm?

1287
01:05:38.750 --> 01:05:39.916
If we don't...

1288
01:05:40.000 --> 01:05:42.583
Don't even... don't even say that.

1289
01:05:42.666 --> 01:05:45.250
Don't even think that. okay?
W-We're gonna get out of here.

1290
01:05:48.041 --> 01:05:50.875
Okay. the whole tunnel has air pockets.
little breaks in the ceiling.

1291
01:05:50.958 --> 01:05:52.916
Okay. so...

1292
01:05:53.000 --> 01:05:55.833
Yeah. we... we swim to the next one
and the next one.

1293
01:05:55.916 --> 01:05:57.916
Okay? Let's do it.

1294
01:05:58.000 --> 01:05:59.750
-[Sara inhales deeply]
-Be like the shark.

1295
01:05:59.833 --> 01:06:01.000
Never stop moving.

1296
01:06:01.083 --> 01:06:02.750
[Max takes deep breath. whimpers softly]

1297
01:06:02.833 --> 01:06:04.333
[inhales deeply]

1298
01:06:05.541 --> 01:06:07.541
[suspenseful music playing]

1299
01:06:11.458 --> 01:06:14.000
[groaning]

1300
01:06:18.500 --> 01:06:21.500
[gasping]

1301
01:06:25.125 --> 01:06:27.125
♪ ♪

1302
01:06:48.166 --> 01:06:50.166
♪ ♪

1303
01:06:58.000 --> 01:06:59.291
[muffled scream]

1304
01:06:59.375 --> 01:07:01.583
[intense music playing]

1305
01:07:13.750 --> 01:07:16.041
[muffled shouting]

1306
01:07:18.333 --> 01:07:21.208
[breathing heavily]

1307
01:07:21.291 --> 01:07:23.416
Go. go. go!

1308
01:07:23.500 --> 01:07:25.083
[inhales deeply]

1309
01:07:32.666 --> 01:07:34.416
[muffled screaming]

1310
01:07:50.750 --> 01:07:52.958
[muffled screaming]

1311
01:07:59.833 --> 01:08:02.458
[gasping]

1312
01:08:02.541 --> 01:08:04.500
-[James] No air.
-[Max] Keep going.

1313
01:08:07.416 --> 01:08:08.958
[inhales deeply]

1314
01:08:11.458 --> 01:08:13.458
[atmospheric music playing]

1315
01:08:20.957 --> 01:08:23.375
-[jarring. intense music playing]
-[muffled whimpering]

1316
01:08:37.791 --> 01:08:39.791
[atmospheric music playing]

1317
01:08:48.832 --> 01:08:50.666
[rock rumbling]

1318
01:08:52.875 --> 01:08:55.375
[muffled. urgent grunting]

1319
01:08:59.875 --> 01:09:02.500
[breathing deeply]

1320
01:09:10.957 --> 01:09:13.082
[breathing heavily]

1321
01:09:17.625 --> 01:09:19.666
[muffled grunting]

1322
01:09:40.791 --> 01:09:42.125
I love you.

1323
01:09:43.207 --> 01:09:45.166
-[mournful music playing]
-[muffled whimpering]

1324
01:09:46.250 --> 01:09:47.500
Keep moving.

1325
01:09:52.166 --> 01:09:54.291
[muffled straining]

1326
01:09:56.375 --> 01:09:58.458
[grunting]

1327
01:10:03.916 --> 01:10:05.125
[gulps]

1328
01:10:05.208 --> 01:10:07.666
[rapid. sharp breaths]

1329
01:10:25.416 --> 01:10:26.916
[sobbing] Sara!

1330
01:10:28.541 --> 01:10:30.208
No. James!

1331
01:10:31.041 --> 01:10:33.166
-No.
-We have to keep moving.

1332
01:10:33.250 --> 01:10:35.375
No. he's... he's right there.

1333
01:10:35.458 --> 01:10:38.916
-We have to keep moving. We do.
-No. No.

1334
01:10:39.000 --> 01:10:40.250
I can't. No.

1335
01:10:41.541 --> 01:10:42.625
You and me.

1336
01:10:42.708 --> 01:10:44.583
No. No! [whimpering]

1337
01:10:44.666 --> 01:10:46.851
-We have to keep going.
-I don't want... No. I don't want to.

1338
01:10:46.875 --> 01:10:49.375
We're gonna make it. We're gonna make it.

1339
01:10:49.458 --> 01:10:52.041
One. two...

1340
01:11:13.791 --> 01:11:15.500
[screams. gasps]

1341
01:11:15.583 --> 01:11:17.750
Jesus! Oh. my God.

1342
01:11:23.000 --> 01:11:25.625
-It was in here.
-What? [whimpers]

1343
01:11:28.291 --> 01:11:30.500
-[both screaming]
-[intense music playing]

1344
01:11:30.583 --> 01:11:32.083
Oh. my God!

1345
01:11:32.166 --> 01:11:35.000
[frantic whimpering. screaming]

1346
01:11:43.666 --> 01:11:45.833
[Max sobbing]

1347
01:11:53.958 --> 01:11:55.958
[hyperventilating]

1348
01:11:58.041 --> 01:12:00.500
We got to go. We got to go.

1349
01:12:07.041 --> 01:12:08.541
[inhales deeply]

1350
01:12:11.250 --> 01:12:13.250
[atmospheric music playing]

1351
01:12:35.916 --> 01:12:37.916
[gasping]

1352
01:12:39.083 --> 01:12:41.208
Okay. get out of the water.

1353
01:12:41.291 --> 01:12:43.375
[both breathing heavily]

1354
01:12:46.333 --> 01:12:48.000
[grunting]

1355
01:12:54.833 --> 01:12:56.833
[tense music playing]

1356
01:13:03.125 --> 01:13:04.208
[screams]

1357
01:13:07.375 --> 01:13:10.791
That's the Ledge Cave.
where we lost Adrienne.

1358
01:13:10.875 --> 01:13:12.500
That's the Devil's Mouth.

1359
01:13:13.708 --> 01:13:15.125
[bats squeaking]

1360
01:13:16.041 --> 01:13:17.708
And that's the ocean outlet.

1361
01:13:25.750 --> 01:13:28.250
[shuddering breaths]

1362
01:13:28.333 --> 01:13:30.166
We're right back where we started.

1363
01:13:30.958 --> 01:13:33.083
[screaming]

1364
01:13:38.500 --> 01:13:40.250
[whimpers]

1365
01:13:43.041 --> 01:13:45.166
[sobbing. hyperventilating]

1366
01:13:58.375 --> 01:14:00.166
[burbling]

1367
01:14:04.708 --> 01:14:06.166
What are you doing?

1368
01:14:06.250 --> 01:14:08.250
I'm taking only what we need.

1369
01:14:11.375 --> 01:14:14.583
Are you blaming me for James?

1370
01:14:14.666 --> 01:14:16.041
[melancholy music playing]

1371
01:14:16.125 --> 01:14:17.500
[Max sobs softly]

1372
01:14:18.541 --> 01:14:19.666
No.

1373
01:14:19.750 --> 01:14:21.875
I tried to save him.

1374
01:14:21.958 --> 01:14:24.458
I-I was pulling.
and I was pulling and pulling and...

1375
01:14:24.541 --> 01:14:27.125
I know. I know you did.

1376
01:14:29.250 --> 01:14:30.458
I loved him.

1377
01:14:30.541 --> 01:14:32.791
-[Max sobbing]
-I loved him. too.

1378
01:14:38.250 --> 01:14:39.625
I know.

1379
01:14:43.250 --> 01:14:45.208
But we tried it your way...

1380
01:14:46.791 --> 01:14:48.916
and we're back to where we started.

1381
01:14:49.916 --> 01:14:51.750
The exit is right there. Sara.

1382
01:14:51.833 --> 01:14:54.125
-[splashing nearby]
-[gasps]

1383
01:14:54.208 --> 01:14:56.041
Shh. Stay here.

1384
01:14:58.375 --> 01:15:00.166
-No. Sara.
-I'll check it out.

1385
01:15:00.250 --> 01:15:01.791
No. No.

1386
01:15:01.875 --> 01:15:03.958
[sobbing]

1387
01:15:07.916 --> 01:15:10.916
-[tense. atmospheric music playing]
-[bats squeaking]

1388
01:15:16.666 --> 01:15:19.125
-[wings fluttering]
-[squeaking continues]

1389
01:15:20.916 --> 01:15:22.833
[jarring. intense music playing]

1390
01:15:22.916 --> 01:15:25.166
[bats squeaking frantically]

1391
01:15:34.833 --> 01:15:35.833
[gasps]

1392
01:15:38.000 --> 01:15:40.500
-What are you doing?
-That's the Blue Tunnel.

1393
01:15:40.583 --> 01:15:41.583
That's the exit.

1394
01:15:42.708 --> 01:15:44.125
Get back.

1395
01:15:51.750 --> 01:15:53.750
[tense. atmospheric music playing]

1396
01:15:56.041 --> 01:15:57.958
[trembling breaths]

1397
01:15:58.041 --> 01:16:00.250
[bats shrieking]

1398
01:16:02.916 --> 01:16:04.333
Freeze.

1399
01:16:04.416 --> 01:16:06.083
I don't want it to see you.

1400
01:16:07.625 --> 01:16:09.625
[bats squeaking]

1401
01:16:09.708 --> 01:16:12.958
[Max shudders. whimpers]

1402
01:16:13.833 --> 01:16:15.125
Where is it?

1403
01:16:17.291 --> 01:16:19.416
-[gasping]
-Shh.

1404
01:16:22.875 --> 01:16:24.875
[Max whimpering softly]

1405
01:16:26.166 --> 01:16:28.166
[atmospheric music playing]

1406
01:16:29.583 --> 01:16:31.583
[breathing heavily]

1407
01:16:42.583 --> 01:16:45.416
I-I can't tell the path. It's too dark.

1408
01:16:47.458 --> 01:16:49.166
Okay. Turn your light on.

1409
01:16:51.208 --> 01:16:52.291
But just briefly. okay?

1410
01:16:52.375 --> 01:16:54.833
I don't want it to see us
if it's still in here.

1411
01:17:00.500 --> 01:17:02.958
[Max breathing heavily]

1412
01:17:12.500 --> 01:17:13.875
[whimpers]

1413
01:17:17.125 --> 01:17:18.958
-What are you doing?
-[gasps]

1414
01:17:19.041 --> 01:17:21.041
-I need to see the way.
-Turn it off.

1415
01:17:41.750 --> 01:17:44.000
[breath trembling]

1416
01:17:52.916 --> 01:17:55.041
[gasping breaths]

1417
01:18:09.916 --> 01:18:12.166
[tense music playing]

1418
01:18:12.250 --> 01:18:14.333
[screaming]

1419
01:18:14.416 --> 01:18:16.208
-Shh!
-[muffled shriek]

1420
01:18:16.291 --> 01:18:17.875
Don't move.

1421
01:18:19.750 --> 01:18:21.375
[whispers] Adrienne.

1422
01:18:22.375 --> 01:18:23.416
Oh. no.

1423
01:18:24.625 --> 01:18:25.708
[Max whimpers]

1424
01:18:28.833 --> 01:18:30.250
You see that spot there?

1425
01:18:30.333 --> 01:18:32.226
We're gonna hide in the stalagmites
until it leaves.

1426
01:18:32.250 --> 01:18:35.166
We can't let it follow us into the tunnel.

1427
01:18:35.250 --> 01:18:36.958
We can't.

1428
01:18:38.041 --> 01:18:40.041
[tense. atmospheric music playing]

1429
01:18:41.875 --> 01:18:43.875
[panting]

1430
01:18:46.916 --> 01:18:49.083
Max. stop.

1431
01:18:49.166 --> 01:18:50.791
No. no. Almost there. So close.

1432
01:18:50.875 --> 01:18:52.666
Goddamn it.

1433
01:18:52.750 --> 01:18:54.875
[loud. gasping breaths]

1434
01:18:58.833 --> 01:19:00.708
Max!

1435
01:19:00.791 --> 01:19:02.125
Look!

1436
01:19:02.208 --> 01:19:05.041
-[intense music playing]
-[screaming]

1437
01:19:05.125 --> 01:19:06.958
Go! Go. go!

1438
01:19:07.041 --> 01:19:09.041
[screaming continues]

1439
01:19:14.916 --> 01:19:16.500
Hey!

1440
01:19:18.791 --> 01:19:21.250
[Max sobbing]

1441
01:19:29.583 --> 01:19:31.333
[screams. sobs]

1442
01:19:35.375 --> 01:19:36.541
Over here!

1443
01:19:36.625 --> 01:19:38.250
[Max screams]

1444
01:19:40.166 --> 01:19:41.291
[screams]

1445
01:19:41.375 --> 01:19:43.291
No. no!

1446
01:19:44.875 --> 01:19:47.166
[sobs. screams]

1447
01:19:47.250 --> 01:19:49.041
[gasping]

1448
01:19:53.375 --> 01:19:55.250
[Sara screams]

1449
01:19:55.333 --> 01:19:57.791
Over here! Hey!

1450
01:19:58.416 --> 01:20:01.541
Hey! I'm over here!

1451
01:20:06.416 --> 01:20:07.916
[growling]

1452
01:20:26.583 --> 01:20:28.791
-Oh. my God.
-We're so close.

1453
01:20:29.291 --> 01:20:31.583
[groans. pants]

1454
01:20:31.666 --> 01:20:32.875
-Can you swim?
-[groans]

1455
01:20:32.958 --> 01:20:35.250
-We're-we're... we're trapped.
-It's okay.

1456
01:20:35.333 --> 01:20:36.541
We go to the ocean outlet.

1457
01:20:36.625 --> 01:20:38.833
[voice fading] If we go now.
we can make it before...

1458
01:20:38.916 --> 01:20:41.166
[disorienting music playing]

1459
01:20:41.250 --> 01:20:43.250
[muffled splash. burbling]

1460
01:20:45.000 --> 01:20:47.000
[atmospheric music playing]

1461
01:21:00.000 --> 01:21:02.000
♪ ♪

1462
01:21:05.666 --> 01:21:07.666
[bats squeaking]

1463
01:21:20.458 --> 01:21:22.458
[both grunting]

1464
01:21:22.541 --> 01:21:24.541
[Max] Where-where is it?

1465
01:21:25.500 --> 01:21:27.000
Dead. I hope.

1466
01:21:27.083 --> 01:21:29.083
[pained whimpering]

1467
01:21:30.583 --> 01:21:33.041
[panting]

1468
01:21:39.833 --> 01:21:44.000
We're not moving to L.A.. are we?

1469
01:21:57.166 --> 01:21:58.958
We're still here.

1470
01:22:03.416 --> 01:22:06.041
And once we get out of here.

1471
01:22:06.125 --> 01:22:10.166
we can do whatever we want
and go wherever we want.

1472
01:22:10.250 --> 01:22:14.583
and we will have
all the time in the world...

1473
01:22:16.041 --> 01:22:18.250
to figure out how to live with this.

1474
01:22:24.291 --> 01:22:26.083
And therapy.

1475
01:22:26.166 --> 01:22:27.166
[Sara chuckles softly]

1476
01:22:27.250 --> 01:22:29.833
New York is probably better
for therapists.

1477
01:22:36.125 --> 01:22:38.291
Keep a lookout. okay?

1478
01:22:38.375 --> 01:22:39.666
[Max] Mm-hmm.

1479
01:22:41.958 --> 01:22:43.125
Okay.

1480
01:22:51.041 --> 01:22:53.041
[tense music playing]

1481
01:23:03.750 --> 01:23:05.291
[yells]

1482
01:23:05.375 --> 01:23:07.000
[panting]

1483
01:23:08.458 --> 01:23:10.583
[strains. yells]

1484
01:23:11.791 --> 01:23:14.083
[breathing heavily]

1485
01:23:26.500 --> 01:23:27.958
[pained grunt]

1486
01:23:37.500 --> 01:23:39.500
[yells]

1487
01:23:39.583 --> 01:23:40.666
[grunts]

1488
01:23:40.750 --> 01:23:41.958
[gasping breaths]

1489
01:23:42.041 --> 01:23:44.250
[Sara whimpering. panting]

1490
01:23:53.958 --> 01:23:55.958
[birds chirping]

1491
01:23:56.041 --> 01:23:58.291
[calm. hopeful music playing]

1492
01:24:03.750 --> 01:24:05.750
[ominous music playing]

1493
01:24:13.875 --> 01:24:15.708
Damn.

1494
01:24:23.291 --> 01:24:25.291
[gentle music playing]

1495
01:24:28.541 --> 01:24:31.083
-What?
-It's just all rocks down below.

1496
01:24:31.166 --> 01:24:33.958
[voice shaking] So it-it's over?

1497
01:24:34.041 --> 01:24:36.708
You-you can't just. like. climb down.
like. w-with-with your rope?

1498
01:24:36.791 --> 01:24:38.750
It's not long enough.

1499
01:24:38.833 --> 01:24:40.458
It's so...

1500
01:24:40.541 --> 01:24:42.000
[sobbing] Oh. my God.

1501
01:24:42.833 --> 01:24:44.517
You-you said... you said
this was gonna work.

1502
01:24:44.541 --> 01:24:46.517
-You said this was gonna work.
-Shh. It's okay. it's okay.

1503
01:24:46.541 --> 01:24:49.375
Let me just think a second. It's...

1504
01:24:50.208 --> 01:24:55.291
It's low tide. so if we just wait for
the tide to come in. and then we can...

1505
01:24:55.375 --> 01:24:57.458
climb out in a few hours.

1506
01:25:01.458 --> 01:25:03.000
Right.

1507
01:25:03.083 --> 01:25:04.625
[takes deep breath]

1508
01:25:05.791 --> 01:25:08.291
-I'll go alone. and hopefully. the...
-[Max sobs]

1509
01:25:08.375 --> 01:25:11.666
water is high enough for me to jump.

1510
01:25:16.666 --> 01:25:18.958
What if it isn't?

1511
01:25:20.583 --> 01:25:22.791
Then I...

1512
01:25:22.875 --> 01:25:25.166
break my legs and drown
and you die by shark. Max.

1513
01:25:25.250 --> 01:25:26.875
I don't know.

1514
01:25:34.000 --> 01:25:35.541
This'll work.

1515
01:25:38.708 --> 01:25:40.375
This is our best shot.

1516
01:25:40.458 --> 01:25:42.458
[birds chirping in distance]

1517
01:25:54.583 --> 01:25:56.583
[ominous music playing]

1518
01:26:00.750 --> 01:26:01.833
[hissing growl]

1519
01:26:07.875 --> 01:26:09.875
[atmospheric music playing]

1520
01:26:25.708 --> 01:26:27.708
[hopeful music playing]

1521
01:26:36.166 --> 01:26:37.666
[grunts softly]

1522
01:26:44.166 --> 01:26:45.791
[Max] Sara!

1523
01:26:48.291 --> 01:26:50.625
You'll send help. right?

1524
01:26:50.708 --> 01:26:54.458
And I know that we've been through hell.
but it's not my fault.

1525
01:26:58.958 --> 01:27:01.000
None of it's my fault.

1526
01:27:03.000 --> 01:27:06.208
God! Don't leave me down here.

1527
01:27:06.291 --> 01:27:08.291
[tense music playing]

1528
01:27:10.333 --> 01:27:12.208
What are you doing? This isn't you!

1529
01:27:12.291 --> 01:27:14.083
People change.

1530
01:27:15.000 --> 01:27:16.666
[inhales sharply]

1531
01:27:22.583 --> 01:27:24.000
[sobbing]

1532
01:27:24.083 --> 01:27:25.291
Hey.

1533
01:27:26.291 --> 01:27:28.125
It's okay. It's just another hour or so.

1534
01:27:28.208 --> 01:27:29.333
What is it?

1535
01:27:35.291 --> 01:27:36.708
[sniffles]

1536
01:27:39.916 --> 01:27:41.125
What?

1537
01:27:41.916 --> 01:27:44.000
I'm gonna die alone down here.

1538
01:27:45.250 --> 01:27:46.666
I know it.

1539
01:27:46.750 --> 01:27:48.750
[soft. mournful music playing]

1540
01:27:50.458 --> 01:27:52.333
[sobbing]

1541
01:27:53.125 --> 01:27:54.500
Hey.

1542
01:27:56.416 --> 01:27:58.125
You and me.

1543
01:27:59.458 --> 01:28:01.750
Till the stars burn out. right?

1544
01:28:04.791 --> 01:28:05.875
[sniffles]

1545
01:28:05.958 --> 01:28:08.083
But you're gonna have to do something

1546
01:28:08.166 --> 01:28:10.500
that neither one of us
has ever done before.

1547
01:28:11.583 --> 01:28:14.250
Swim with a broken hand?

1548
01:28:15.250 --> 01:28:16.583
No.

1549
01:28:17.833 --> 01:28:19.375
Trust me.

1550
01:28:35.041 --> 01:28:37.041
[waves rumbling]

1551
01:28:37.125 --> 01:28:39.500
I can hear the waves crashing closer.

1552
01:28:44.416 --> 01:28:46.291
So you'll-you'll send help?

1553
01:28:47.000 --> 01:28:48.958
-Of course I will.
-Sara. wait.

1554
01:28:49.041 --> 01:28:52.875
My whole life.
I thought I had to be the strong one.

1555
01:28:55.583 --> 01:28:58.500
For my dad. for my friends.

1556
01:29:00.125 --> 01:29:01.958
I thought I had to carry that weight.

1557
01:29:03.291 --> 01:29:05.083
But I never saw you.

1558
01:29:08.041 --> 01:29:10.041
How strong you were.

1559
01:29:11.708 --> 01:29:13.666
And I'm so sorry.

1560
01:29:15.666 --> 01:29:17.750
I am so...

1561
01:29:17.833 --> 01:29:20.125
[crying] I am so very sorry.

1562
01:29:23.291 --> 01:29:25.291
I'm coming back for you.

1563
01:29:30.958 --> 01:29:32.958
[quiet. tense music playing]

1564
01:29:38.500 --> 01:29:40.708
-[grunting]
-[waves crashing]

1565
01:29:43.791 --> 01:29:45.791
[panting]

1566
01:29:59.583 --> 01:30:01.583
[determined music playing]

1567
01:30:09.250 --> 01:30:10.500
Wait!

1568
01:30:10.583 --> 01:30:12.000
Please!

1569
01:30:12.083 --> 01:30:15.000
What? What are you doing?

1570
01:30:15.083 --> 01:30:16.791
Get back to the rock!

1571
01:30:16.875 --> 01:30:18.541
I-I'm coming with you.

1572
01:30:18.625 --> 01:30:20.375
You can't. Your hand.

1573
01:30:20.458 --> 01:30:21.916
I'll come back for you.

1574
01:30:22.000 --> 01:30:23.208
[grunts]

1575
01:30:23.291 --> 01:30:25.291
I can do this. Max.

1576
01:30:25.375 --> 01:30:27.000
Please. don't leave me.

1577
01:30:30.833 --> 01:30:33.208
[sighs. sniffles]

1578
01:30:34.666 --> 01:30:36.416
Can you get up here?

1579
01:30:37.416 --> 01:30:39.833
[grunting]

1580
01:30:39.916 --> 01:30:41.625
[yelps]

1581
01:30:43.000 --> 01:30:44.208
[gasping]

1582
01:30:44.291 --> 01:30:45.666
[Sara] Okay. hold on.

1583
01:30:45.750 --> 01:30:47.666
[panicked whimpering. gasping]

1584
01:30:48.958 --> 01:30:51.083
Help. [whimpers]

1585
01:30:51.166 --> 01:30:52.833
Go. grab the rope.

1586
01:30:52.916 --> 01:30:54.750
Just tie it around your waist and knot it.

1587
01:30:55.500 --> 01:30:56.958
As tight as you can.

1588
01:30:57.041 --> 01:30:59.041
[waves crashing]

1589
01:30:59.125 --> 01:31:01.166
[dramatic music playing]

1590
01:31:15.375 --> 01:31:17.125
[exhales sharply]

1591
01:31:22.666 --> 01:31:23.666
[Max whimpers]

1592
01:31:23.750 --> 01:31:24.875
-Okay.
-Ready?

1593
01:31:24.958 --> 01:31:26.416
[panting] Yeah.

1594
01:31:26.500 --> 01:31:27.500
Start climbing.

1595
01:31:31.416 --> 01:31:33.541
[pained grunting]

1596
01:31:34.541 --> 01:31:35.666
[whimpers]

1597
01:31:42.083 --> 01:31:43.333
[panting] Okay.

1598
01:31:43.416 --> 01:31:45.208
Okay. Okay. [whimpers]

1599
01:31:47.208 --> 01:31:48.333
[screams]

1600
01:31:49.666 --> 01:31:51.250
My feet keep slipping!

1601
01:31:51.333 --> 01:31:52.625
All right.

1602
01:31:53.625 --> 01:31:55.125
Try again.

1603
01:31:55.208 --> 01:31:57.208
[whimpering]

1604
01:31:57.291 --> 01:31:58.833
[panting] Okay.

1605
01:32:01.708 --> 01:32:02.875
[groans]

1606
01:32:02.958 --> 01:32:04.041
Okay.

1607
01:32:04.125 --> 01:32:05.958
[panting] Okay.

1608
01:32:06.041 --> 01:32:08.583
[whimpers. groans]

1609
01:32:09.833 --> 01:32:11.041
[straining]

1610
01:32:12.916 --> 01:32:14.458
Okay. [grunts]

1611
01:32:16.500 --> 01:32:19.000
We're doing it. Sara! We're doing it!

1612
01:32:19.083 --> 01:32:20.291
[gasps]

1613
01:32:23.083 --> 01:32:25.083
[screaming]

1614
01:32:28.458 --> 01:32:29.708
[yelps]

1615
01:32:31.166 --> 01:32:32.958
[yells]

1616
01:32:33.041 --> 01:32:35.500
[muffled shouting]

1617
01:32:35.583 --> 01:32:37.583
[tense music playing]

1618
01:32:46.500 --> 01:32:47.750
[yelps]

1619
01:32:55.791 --> 01:32:58.000
[gasping]

1620
01:33:05.208 --> 01:33:06.916
[shudders] Max.

1621
01:33:07.000 --> 01:33:08.666
[whimpers]

1622
01:33:08.750 --> 01:33:11.125
[grunting]

1623
01:33:12.458 --> 01:33:14.375
[breathing heavily]

1624
01:33:14.458 --> 01:33:16.458
[somber music playing]

1625
01:33:21.583 --> 01:33:24.333
[groaning]

1626
01:33:28.750 --> 01:33:30.750
[panting]

1627
01:33:37.416 --> 01:33:39.500
"Respect the caves."

1628
01:33:39.583 --> 01:33:41.541
This is the Skeleton Cave.

1629
01:33:41.625 --> 01:33:44.083
We are guests here. Caves are master.

1630
01:34:03.500 --> 01:34:04.708
[Max] Sara.

1631
01:34:04.791 --> 01:34:06.458
Emergency photo op.

1632
01:34:14.625 --> 01:34:16.625
[grunting. panting]

1633
01:34:24.708 --> 01:34:26.791
-[Wat] This rock very weak.
-[screams]

1634
01:34:26.875 --> 01:34:28.541
You cause collapse. we die.

1635
01:34:51.166 --> 01:34:53.166
[muffled splashing]

1636
01:35:02.916 --> 01:35:04.458
[splashing]

1637
01:35:12.375 --> 01:35:13.708
Hey!

1638
01:35:15.250 --> 01:35:17.166
Come and get it!

1639
01:35:19.666 --> 01:35:21.500
[splashing]

1640
01:35:23.791 --> 01:35:25.791
[panting]

1641
01:35:39.625 --> 01:35:41.625
[atmospheric music playing]

1642
01:35:45.625 --> 01:35:47.250
Dinnertime.

1643
01:35:50.125 --> 01:35:52.541
[tense music playing]

1644
01:35:53.416 --> 01:35:56.416
[splashing]

1645
01:36:03.541 --> 01:36:05.541
[intense. suspenseful music playing]

1646
01:36:18.083 --> 01:36:19.416
[groans]

1647
01:36:19.500 --> 01:36:22.000
[music fades]

1648
01:36:26.541 --> 01:36:28.166
[splashing]

1649
01:36:32.291 --> 01:36:33.833
Come on!

1650
01:36:33.916 --> 01:36:36.208
[intense. suspenseful music playing]

1651
01:36:36.291 --> 01:36:38.291
Come on!

1652
01:36:43.791 --> 01:36:45.000
[growling]

1653
01:36:49.500 --> 01:36:51.375
[pained grunting]

1654
01:36:54.833 --> 01:36:57.041
-Come on. Get back.
-[splashing]

1655
01:36:57.125 --> 01:36:59.583
Come back. One more time. Come back!

1656
01:37:20.083 --> 01:37:21.416
[shark growling]

1657
01:37:26.041 --> 01:37:28.333
[rumbling]

1658
01:37:34.083 --> 01:37:35.708
[groans]

1659
01:37:35.791 --> 01:37:38.416
[somber music playing]

1660
01:37:57.375 --> 01:37:59.875
[gasping]

1661
01:37:59.958 --> 01:38:01.750
[coughs]

1662
01:38:01.833 --> 01:38:03.833
[rapid. trembling breaths]

1663
01:38:07.333 --> 01:38:09.333
[hopeful music playing]

1664
01:38:25.708 --> 01:38:27.708
♪ ♪

1665
01:38:30.500 --> 01:38:31.625
[whimpers]

1666
01:38:31.708 --> 01:38:33.666
[birds chirping]

1667
01:38:33.750 --> 01:38:36.166
[panting. whimpering]

1668
01:38:51.500 --> 01:38:52.791
[sniffles]

1669
01:39:00.166 --> 01:39:01.708
[chuckles]

1670
01:39:03.791 --> 01:39:06.166
[laughs loudly]

1671
01:39:06.250 --> 01:39:08.083
[screams]

1672
01:39:08.166 --> 01:39:11.708
[echoing scream]

1673
01:39:11.791 --> 01:39:13.791
[triumphant music playing]

1674
01:39:29.625 --> 01:39:31.625
[music fades]

1675
01:39:33.500 --> 01:39:35.500
[dramatic music playing]

1676
01:40:05.500 --> 01:40:07.500
♪ ♪

1677
01:40:37.500 --> 01:40:39.500
♪ ♪

1678
01:41:09.500 --> 01:41:11.500
♪ ♪

1679
01:41:41.500 --> 01:41:43.500
♪ ♪

1680
01:42:13.500 --> 01:42:15.500
♪ ♪

1681
01:42:18.416 --> 01:42:20.416
